{"seq":2,"slug":"quantization","title":"量化精度与动态范围","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/digital-audio-basics/quantization","wordCount":1550,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"量化精度与动态范围\">量化精度与动态范围</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>量化解决的是一维问题：如何用有限个离散级别逼近连续振幅。它的核心概念彼此连锁：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>量化步长与量化噪声</strong>：步长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span></span></span></span> 满刻度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>N</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">/ 2^N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0913em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，最大误差为半步长，取整误差累积为量化噪声。</li>\n<li><strong>动态范围</strong>：最大不失真电平与本底噪声之差，16-bit 约 96 dB，24-bit 约 144 dB。</li>\n<li><strong>SNR 与位深</strong>：均匀量化下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6.02</mn><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1.76</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SNR_{max} = 6.02N + 1.76</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6.02</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.76</span></span></span></span></span> dB，每增加 1 bit 约换来 6 dB 信噪比。</li>\n<li><strong>Dithering</strong>：降位深前注入极低电平随机噪声，打断量化误差与信号的相关性，用轻微底噪换取谐波失真的消除。</li>\n<li><strong>定点与浮点</strong>：定点精度固定，浮点精度随信号电平自适应，这是 DAW 内部普遍采用浮点的根本原因。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>权衡点在于：位深、存储空间与后处理余量三者不可能同时最大化，Dithering 又用一点本底噪声换取听感上的纯净。</p>\n<h2 id=\"量化的数学本质\">量化的数学本质</h2><p>量化（Quantization）是将连续的模拟振幅值映射为有限个离散级别的过程。若使用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 位（bit）表示每个采样值，则可用的量化级别数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>N</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>16-bit：</mtext><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>65536</mn><mtext> 个级别</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{16-bit：} 2^{16} = 65536 \\text{ 个级别}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">16-bit</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">：</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">16</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65536</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">个级别</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>24-bit：</mtext><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>24</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16777216</mn><mtext> 个级别</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{24-bit：} 2^{24} = 16777216 \\text{ 个级别}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">24-bit</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">：</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">24</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16777216</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">个级别</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>量化过程本质上是一种&quot;取整&quot;操作——真实振幅值被四舍五入到最近的量化级别。这个取整误差就是<strong>量化噪声</strong>（Quantization Noise），其最大值为半个量化步长。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>量化步长</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>满刻度范围</mtext><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>N</mi></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{量化步长} = \\frac{\\text{满刻度范围}}{2^N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">量化步长</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7673em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">满刻度范围</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>最大量化误差</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mfrac><mtext>步长</mtext><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{最大量化误差} = \\pm \\frac{\\text{步长}}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最大量化误差</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">步长</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;连续振幅值&lt;br/&gt;如 0.3728...&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;映射到最近级别&lt;br/&gt;如 0.375&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;量化误差&lt;br/&gt;= 0.3728 - 0.375&lt;br/&gt;= -0.0022&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;误差累积 = 量化噪声&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"连续振幅值&lt;br/&gt;如 0.3728...\"] --&gt; B[\"映射到最近级别&lt;br/&gt;如 0.375\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"量化误差&lt;br/&gt;= 0.3728 - 0.375&lt;br/&gt;= -0.0022\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"误差累积 = 量化噪声\"]</pre><h2 id=\"snr-与位深度的经典关系\">SNR 与位深度的经典关系</h2><p>信噪比（Signal-to-Noise Ratio, SNR）是衡量音频质量的核心指标。对于均匀量化的 PCM 编码，理论最大 SNR 与位深度的关系为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>SNR</mtext><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6.02</mn><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1.76</mn><mtext> dB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SNR}_{max} = 6.02N + 1.76 \\text{ dB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SNR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6.02</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.76</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> dB</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>位深度</th>\n<th>量化级别</th>\n<th>理论 SNR</th>\n<th>动态范围</th>\n<th>应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>8 bit</td>\n<td>256</td>\n<td>49.9 dB</td>\n<td>~50 dB</td>\n<td>早期游戏/语音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16 bit</td>\n<td>65536</td>\n<td>98.1 dB</td>\n<td>~96 dB</td>\n<td>CD/消费级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>24 bit</td>\n<td>16.7M</td>\n<td>146.2 dB</td>\n<td>~144 dB</td>\n<td>专业录音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>32 bit float</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>~1528 dB</td>\n<td>理论无限</td>\n<td>DAW 内部处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>动态范围</strong>（Dynamic Range）是最大不失真电平与本底噪声之间的 dB 差。16-bit 提供约 96 dB 的动态范围，足以覆盖从最安静的耳语到最响亮的管弦乐全奏。24-bit 的 144 dB 动态范围远超任何物理环境的实际需求（宇宙射线辐射的噪声约为 -120 dBFS），但为后期处理提供了充裕的余量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dithering-技术\">Dithering 技术</h2><p>当从高位深降低到低位深时（如 24-bit → 16-bit 母带制作），直接截断（truncation）会引入相关性量化失真——表现为与信号相关的不自然谐波畸变。</p>\n<p><strong>Dithering</strong> 通过在截断前添加极低电平的随机噪声来消除这种相关性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mtext> 为随机噪声</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{dithered}[n] = x[n] + d[n] \\quad (d[n] \\text{ 为随机噪声})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">为随机噪声</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Dithering 的代价是轻微抬升了本底噪声，但换来了量化失真的完全消除。对于音乐信号而言，均匀的白噪声底底远比信号相关的谐波失真更容易被人耳忽略。</p>\n<p>常见 Dithering 类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>噪声特征</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RPDF (矩形)</td>\n<td>平坦频谱</td>\n<td>基础降位深</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TPDF (三角)</td>\n<td>平坦频谱，无调制噪声</td>\n<td>专业标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Noise-shaped</td>\n<td>高频集中</td>\n<td>最终母带输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>POW-r</td>\n<td>心理声学加权</td>\n<td>精细音乐母带</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;24-bit 源&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;直接截断 16-bit&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Dithering + 截断&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;有谐波失真&lt;br/&gt;(刺耳)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;仅有均匀底噪&lt;br/&gt;(自然)&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"24-bit 源\"] --&gt; B[\"直接截断 16-bit\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Dithering + 截断\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"有谐波失真&lt;br/&gt;(刺耳)\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"仅有均匀底噪&lt;br/&gt;(自然)\"]</pre><h2 id=\"浮点数与定点数\">浮点数与定点数</h2><p>现代 DAW 内部几乎全部使用 <strong>32-bit 浮点</strong>或 <strong>64-bit 浮点</strong>进行音频计算。浮点数的优势在于其巨大的动态范围——即使信号在处理过程中暂时超过 0 dBFS（Full Scale），也不会产生硬削波，因为浮点数可以表示远超 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 1.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span></span></span></span></span> 的值。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>32-bit float</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>1 位符号</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>8 位指数</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>23 位尾数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{32-bit float} = \\text{1 位符号} + \\text{8 位指数} + \\text{23 位尾数}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">32-bit float</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">1 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">位符号</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">8 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">位指数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">23 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">位尾数</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>有效精度</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>24</mn><mtext> bit（在任何信号电平下）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{有效精度} \\approx 24 \\text{ bit（在任何信号电平下）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有效精度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> bit</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（在任何信号电平下）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>浮点的关键优势：<strong>精度随信号电平自适应</strong>。无论信号是 0 dBFS 还是 -100 dBFS，浮点格式都保持约 24-bit 的有效精度。而定点 16-bit 在 -60 dBFS 时仅剩约 6-bit 有效精度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>位宽</th>\n<th>动态范围</th>\n<th>精度特征</th>\n<th>应用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>16-bit int</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>96 dB</td>\n<td>固定精度</td>\n<td>CD 发行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>24-bit int</td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>144 dB</td>\n<td>固定精度</td>\n<td>录音/归档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>32-bit float</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>~1528 dB</td>\n<td>自适应精度</td>\n<td>DAW 处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>64-bit float</td>\n<td>64</td>\n<td>极大</td>\n<td>极高精度</td>\n<td>科学计算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"音频编码格式生态\">音频编码格式生态</h2><p>数字音频的存储与传输格式分为三大类：</p>\n<p><strong>无损格式</strong>（Lossless）：完全保留原始 PCM 数据，仅做可逆压缩。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>WAV/AIFF：无压缩 PCM 容器，录音棚标准</li>\n<li>FLAC：开源无损压缩，压缩率约 50-60%</li>\n<li>ALAC：Apple 生态无损压缩</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>有损格式</strong>（Lossy）：利用心理声学模型去除人耳不敏感的信息。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MP3：历史最悠久，兼容性最强</li>\n<li>AAC：MP3 的继任者，同比特率音质更优</li>\n<li>Opus：开源，低延迟，适应性强</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>高解析格式</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DSD：1-bit/2.8-5.6 MHz，SACD 格式</li>\n<li>MQA：有争议的&quot;折叠&quot;高解析编码</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>比特率</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mtext>channels</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{比特率} = f_s \\times N \\times \\text{channels}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">比特率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">channels</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CD 比特率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>44100</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1411.2</mn><mtext> kbps</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CD 比特率} = 44100 \\times 16 \\times 2 = 1411.2 \\text{ kbps}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CD </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">比特率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">44100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1411.2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> kbps</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>2024-2025 年，Apple Music 与 Spotify 在无损/空间音频的竞争推动了高品质流媒体的普及。Spotify 于 2024 年终于推出了 HiFi 层级（CD 品质 FLAC 流媒体），结束了多年的承诺延迟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>量化把连续振幅折叠为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>N</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个离散级别，误差的统计特性决定了音质的下限：均匀量化给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6.02</mn><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1.76</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6.02N + 1.76</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6.02</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.76</span></span></span></span></span> dB 的经典信噪比关系，位深每提高一档便多约 6 dB 动态范围。Dithering 把相关失真转化为听感更自然的均匀底噪，是降位深不可省略的一步。浮点格式凭借自适应精度成为 DAW 内部处理的默认选择，只在最终发行时才降采样为定点。存储格式上，无损、有损与高解析三条路线各有取舍，而流媒体时代的竞争正把无损推向消费级默认。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"量化精度与动态范围","id":"量化精度与动态范围"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"量化的数学本质","id":"量化的数学本质"},{"level":2,"text":"SNR 与位深度的经典关系","id":"snr-与位深度的经典关系"},{"level":2,"text":"Dithering 技术","id":"dithering-技术"},{"level":2,"text":"浮点数与定点数","id":"浮点数与定点数"},{"level":2,"text":"音频编码格式生态","id":"音频编码格式生态"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"采样定理与模数转换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/digital-audio-basics/sampling-theorem"},"next":{"title":"音频编解码与传输","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/digital-audio-basics/codec-formats"}}